### 6\. Template engines

High priority

These engines process templates to generate dynamic content.

| Language   | Template engine                 |
| ---------- | ------------------------------- |
| Python     | Jinja2, Mako                    |
| PHP        | Twig, Smarty, Blade             |
| Java       | FreeMarker, Velocity, Thymeleaf |
| JavaScript | EJS, Pug, Handlebars, Nunjucks  |
| Ruby       | ERB, Liquid                     |
| .NET       | Razor                           |
| Go         | html/template, text/template    |

Investigate whether user-controlled input becomes template source rather than ordinary template data. This is the central issue in server-side template injection (SSTI). OWASP Web Security Testing Guide +1

### 7\. Database and database-extension components

| Component                  | Examples                              |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Database engines           | MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, Oracle |
| Stored procedures          | PL/SQL, T-SQL, PostgreSQL functions   |
| Database extensions        | Native extensions and plugins         |
| User-defined functions     | UDFs                                  |
| Database language runtimes | PL/Python, PL/Perl and similar        |
| Import/export processors   | CSV, SQL dumps, backup restoration    |
| Database drivers           | JDBC, ODBC, native client libraries   |

Investigate whether database features can invoke external programs, load native extensions, or execute unsafe stored logic. SQL injection alone is not automatically RCE.

### 8\. Application plugins and extension systems

| Component                | Examples                                    |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |
| CMS plugins              | WordPress, Drupal, Joomla                   |
| CMS themes               | PHP-based themes and templates              |
| Browser extensions       | Chrome and Firefox extensions               |
| IDE extensions           | VS Code and JetBrains plugins               |
| Java application plugins | JAR-based plugins                           |
