| Android dynamic features | Downloaded modules and dynamic code loading |
| Game server plugins      | Java, Lua and native plugins                |

Investigate plugin installation permissions, signature verification, dependency integrity, update mechanisms and whether untrusted users can install or influence extensions.

### 9\. XML, document and markup components

| Component                  | Relevant technologies                     |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| XML parsers                | Xerces, libxml2                           |
| XML transformations        | XSLT processors                           |
| XML object binding         | JAXB and similar frameworks               |
| SVG rendering              | SVG engines                               |
| HTML rendering             | Browser and server-side rendering engines |
| Markdown rendering         | Markdown processors                       |
| Office document processing | DOCX, XLSX, PPTX parsers                  |
| PDF rendering              | PDF engines                               |
| PostScript processing      | PostScript interpreters                   |

Look for unsafe external resource resolution, vulnerable parsers, dangerous transformation extensions and unsafe document conversion. XXE often causes file disclosure or server-side requests rather than RCE directly; additional conditions are needed for code execution.

### 10\. Network and message-processing components

| Component                 | Examples                              |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| HTTP request parsers      | Apache, Nginx, application frameworks |
| WebSocket handlers        | WebSocket servers                     |
| RPC frameworks            | gRPC, XML-RPC, JSON-RPC               |
| Message brokers           | RabbitMQ, Kafka, ActiveMQ             |
| Remote procedure services | Java RMI, .NET remoting legacy        |
